  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Driving Marawi&#x2019;s Rehabilitation through IDP Support, Community Development and Peaceful Transitional Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programming aims to strengthen the resilience of vulnerable internally displaced persons (IDPs), returnees and host communities across all 72 accessible barangays in Marawi City. It seeks to address the major drivers of instability and displacement by improving local governance, social cohesion and community stabilization combined with psychosocial support, as well as support for socioeconomic development through integrated livelihood assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
